From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:43:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: Settings-wide Sable focus ring

The approved Settings design draws keyboard focus as an accent fill
with an accent border. Only the Battery pages had a ring (a text-colour
stroke). SableFocusDecoration now draws the accent fill (translucent, so
the row text stays legible) and a 2dp accent border, and is installed
on every Settings list from SettingsPreferenceFragment and by
SableAppListKeyboard. One ring per list: installOn() is idempotent and
only the owner of a ring removes it. Hidden in touch mode.
